1. Loop = means forever chalne wala jb tk usko rokenge ni tb tk chalta hi rhega.

println!("value of number is {num}");
y hmeasa hi no. ko print krte hi rhega same.

num = num + 1;
isliya isko hm + 1 kr denge taki y no. change kr de.

if num == 10{
    break;
}
- taki jaisae hi no. print hoke 10 p aye to break means ruk jaye.
